    "turn_idx": 15,
    "turn_text": "I'm good. Lots of changes since the last time we've spoken. And I know that one of the things you've been addressing on Capitol Hill this week is the stop act, which is kind of tied into immigration, which is tied into some of the changes at DHS. So a lot of intermixed parts this week.",
