    "turn_idx": 23,
    "turn_text": "You know, I take a lot of criticism sometimes for being anti-illegal immigration, but it's not that I'm anti-immigration at all. It's that I think there should be a method, a system, to come into the country legally and fulfill a spot. We just can't have open borders, but right now that seems to be the rallying cry for so many of these Democratic candidates who are getting into the race for 2020, and even if they're not running for president in two years, that seems to be part of their overall political philosophy now.",
